From e5a329fca25876e8c547a266c2ea4a95d0ea7754 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Oliver Beard <olib141@outlook.com>
Date: Sat, 28 Nov 2026 12:23:26 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] autologin: add option to lock the session after logging in

Automatic login always opened an unlocked session. A new option in the
KCM, off by default, makes the daemon mark the autologin session locked
through logind, so the user boots straight to the lock screen.

BUG: 346741
